.env.production
# NativePHP Electron build envs: electron-vite inlines
# MAIN_VITE_NATIVEPHP_BUILD_PATH from these at build time. Without
# .env.production the packaged main process crashes on startup
# (path.resolve receives undefined). Must be committed.
!nativephp/electron/.env.production
!nativephp/electron/.env.development
