/public/storage
# Staged STT weights (base.en, 142MB — over GitHub's 100MB file cap).
# Fetched by CI at build time; never committed. Ships inside installers,
# seeded to user storage on first boot (ModelManager::ensureBundled).
/resources/models/*.bin
/storage/*.key
/storage/pail
